sentences.text:
In view of the above discussion, the petitioners are held entitled to enhanced compensation @Rs. 14,974/- per sq. yard with respect to the land acquired as mentioned in the statement under Section 19 of the Act, 1894 alongwith 30%
solatium under Section 23(2) of Act, in lieu of compulsory acquisition of land;
interest @ 12% per annum under section 23(1A) from the date of notification upto the date of award by LAC or date of taking of possession whichever is earlier; 9% interest on excess amount awarded by court from the date of possession of land for period upto one year; and 15% per annum interest on such excess amount for subsequent period till amount is deposited in court under Section 28 of the Act.
